# Test fixture (tests/dialogue_test.gd, and later suites): a curandera with a
# type, a quest and an item. Every text is a placeholder.

== character fx_curandera
name: Fx Curandera
type: fx_trade
body: duelist
voice: female
colour: copal
intent: a healer who wants a book

== beat open_first
when: not(met)
Fx Curandera [flare]: <<She reads you.>>
Sense obsidian: <<The copal bends toward your shoulder.>>
> <<Ask about the book.>> -> asked
> <<Leave.>> -> end

== beat open
Fx Curandera: <<Back again.>>
> [if said(asked)] <<Ask about the book again.>> -> asked
> [if has(fx_book)] <<Hand over the book.>> -> handed
> <<Never mind.>> -> end

== beat asked
do: set(asked), goal(fx_bring_book)
Fx Curandera: <<Bring me the book from the librarian.>>
> <<Ask for the book as a gift.>> -> gifted
> <<Leave.>> -> end

== beat gifted
Fx Curandera: <<Take it, then.>>
> <<Take the book.>> -> end {do: give(fx_book)}

== beat handed
Fx Curandera [nod]: <<At last.>>
> [if has(fx_book)] <<Hand it over.>> -> end {do: take(fx_book)}
> <<Change your mind.>> -> end

== beat limpia
Fx Curandera: <<Her own cleansing.>>
-> end

== item fx_book
name: The Fx Book
look: book
intent: the book the curandera wants

== goal fx_bring_book
kind: side
shows: said(fx_curandera.asked)
done: gave(fx_curandera.fx_book)
text: <<Bring the curandera her book.>>
